er is, by definition, unknown). So every live prediction from this model is out-of-distribution relative to its own training. The measured t0-window numbers above already reflect that (they are not a surprise), but this is 'best available', not 'production-ready' -- represent it that way. The operating_point (floor=0.0, mult=0.9) is the VAL-selected connected-causal decode point; it did NOT clear the 0.50 precision floor during selection (feasible=False, val P=0.270/R=0.259) -- it's the best-F1 fallback point, not a precision-guaranteed one.","issued_at_utc":"2026-07-30 18:12:55.648757+00:00","valid_from_utc":"2026-07-30 00:00:00","valid_to_utc":"2026-07-31 00:00:00","wfigs_date_current_utc":"2026-07-30 16:23:23+00:00","pixel_size_m":30,"veg_source":"refreshed_d4","physics_source":"eikonal_fbfm40","history_n_dates":1,"degraded_history":true,"containment_pct":95,"acres_wfigs":12781.633597236289,"hour":1,"valid_at_utc":"2026-07-30 01:00:00"}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-112.52837,40.13257],[-112.52802,40.13257],[-112.52802,40.1323],[-112.52837,40.1323],[-112.52837,40.13257]]],[[[-112.52767,40.13257],[-112.52802,40.13257],[-112.52802,40.13284],[-112.52767,40.13284],[-112.52767,40.13257]]],[[[-112.5252,40.14254],[-112.5252,40.14281],[-112.52555,40.14281],[-112.52555,40.14308],[-112.5245,40.14308],[-112.5245,40.14254],[-112.5252,40.14254]]],[[[-112.56188,40.1544],[-112.56152,40.1544],[-112.56152,40.15413],[-112.56188,40.15413],[-112.56188,40.1544]]],[[[-112.56928,40.15952],[-112.56893,40.15952],[-112.56893,40.15925],[-112.56928,40.15925],[-112.56928,40.15952]]],[[[-112.52062,40.19967],[-112.51815,40.19967],[-112.51815,40.19994],[-112.51744,40.19994],[-112.51744,40.19967],[-112.51709,40.19967],[-112.51709,40.19914],[-112.5178,40.19914],[-112.5178,40.19941],[-112.51815,40.19941],[-112.51815,40.19887],[-112.51991,40.19887],[-112.51991,40.1986],[-112.52062,40.1986],[-112.52062,40.19833],[-112.52132,40.19806],[-112.52132,40.19779],[-