agged growth is wrong), and wind_run actually edges it on F1. IMPORTANT CAVEAT: arrival_run trained on the leaky 'observed' corpus (crop centered/sized on t0|t1, i.e. it saw the future perimeter's geometry during training) and has NEVER seen a t0-window crop -- the ONLY geometry this live pipeline can ever produce at forecast time (the future perimeter is, by definition, unknown). So every live prediction from this model is out-of-distribution relative to its own training. The measured t0-window numbers above already reflect that (they are not a surprise), but this is 'best available', not 'production-ready' -- represent it that way. The operating_point (floor=0.0, mult=0.9) is the VAL-selected connected-causal decode point; it did NOT clear the 0.50 precision floor during selection (feasible=False, val P=0.270/R=0.259) -- it's the best-F1 fallback point, not a precision-guaranteed one.","issued_at_utc":"2026-07-30 18:12:55.648757+00:00","valid_from_utc":"2026-07-30 00:00:00","valid_to_utc":"2026-07-31 00:00:00","wfigs_date_current_utc":"2026-07-30 16:23:23+00:00","pixel_size_m":30,"veg_source":"refreshed_d4","physics_source":"eikonal_fbfm40","history_n_dates":1,"degraded_history":true,"containment_pct":95,"acres_wfigs":12781.633597236289,"hour":6,"valid_at_utc":"2026-07-30 06:00:00"}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-112.57563,40.12772],[-112.57528,40.12772],[-112.57528,40.12745],[-112.57457,40.12745],[-112.57457,40.12691],[-112.57528,40.12718],[-112.57528,40.12583],[-112.57563,40.12583],[-112.57563,40.1261],[-112.57634,40.1261],[-112.57634,40.12691],[-112.57704,40.12664],[-112.57704,40.12772],[-112.57669,40.12772],[-112.57669,40.12745],[-112.57634,40.12745],[-112.57634,40.12772],[-112.57563,40.12745],[-112.57563,40.12772]],[[-112.57598,40.12664],[-112.57598,40.12637],[-112.57563,40.12637],[-112.57563,40.12664],[-112.57598,40.12664]]],[[[-112.57422,40.12745],[-112.57387,40.12745],[-112.57387,40.12718],[-112.57422,40.12718],[-11