ecast time (the future perimeter is, by definition, unknown). So every live prediction from this model is out-of-distribution relative to its own training. The measured t0-window numbers above already reflect that (they are not a surprise), but this is 'best available', not 'production-ready' -- represent it that way. The operating_point (floor=0.0, mult=0.9) is the VAL-selected connected-causal decode point; it did NOT clear the 0.50 precision floor during selection (feasible=False, val P=0.270/R=0.259) -- it's the best-F1 fallback point, not a precision-guaranteed one.","issued_at_utc":"2026-07-30 18:12:55.648757+00:00","valid_from_utc":"2026-07-30 00:00:00","valid_to_utc":"2026-07-31 00:00:00","wfigs_date_current_utc":"2026-07-30 16:23:23+00:00","pixel_size_m":30,"veg_source":"refreshed_d4","physics_source":"eikonal_fbfm40","history_n_dates":1,"degraded_history":true,"containment_pct":95,"acres_wfigs":12781.633597236289,"hour":10,"valid_at_utc":"2026-07-30 10:00:00"}},{"type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"MultiPolygon","coordinates":[[[[-112.57281,40.10185],[-112.57246,40.10185],[-112.57246,40.10158],[-112.57281,40.10158],[-112.57281,40.10185]]],[[[-112.57422,40.10239],[-112.57387,40.10239],[-112.57387,40.10212],[-112.57422,40.10212],[-112.57422,40.10239]]],[[[-112.57422,40.104],[-112.57387,40.104],[-112.57387,40.10374],[-112.57422,40.10374],[-112.57422,40.104]]],[[[-112.5721,40.10616],[-112.57175,40.10616],[-112.57175,40.10562],[-112.57246,40.10562],[-112.57246,40.104],[-112.57281,40.104],[-112.57281,40.10562],[-112.57316,40.10562],[-112.57316,40.10427],[-112.57352,40.10427],[-112.57352,40.10508],[-112.57422,40.10481],[-112.57422,40.10535],[-112.57493,40.10535],[-112.57493,40.10562],[-112.57457,40.10562],[-112.57457,40.10589],[-112.57422,40.10589],[-112.57422,40.10616],[-112.57387,40.10616],[-112.57387,40.10589],[-112.57352,40.10589],[-112.57352,40.10616],[-112.57246,40.10616],[-112.57246,40.10589],[-112.5721,40.10589],[-112.5721,40.10616]]],[[[-112.57563,40.106